 - Views: quiz `show` adds `<form POST games><button>Start a game</button></form>` next to Preview/Export. Big screen (`moderate/games/show`): `cover--blue .screen` + `#screen-body` + `.screen-controls #screen-actions`; lobby `.lobby` with `.lobby__title` (quiz), `.lobby__url#join-url` (plain text display), `.qr` (SVG), `#players-counter` (`Players: N`), `Start`; open `.stage-question__num` (`Question N of M`), `.stage-question__body`, `ol.stage-options>li.stage-option` (letter+title), `#answers-counter` (`Answers: X / Y`), `Finish`; closed adds `stage-options--results`, `is-correct`, `.stage-option__count` (number), `.stage-option__mark` (`Correct`), `Next`/`End quiz`; ended `The quiz is over`. Player (`plays/show`): over → `.play-title` over (+ greeting if joined); join → `.play-title` quiz + `label Your name` + `input#player_name[placeholder/aria Your name]` + `button Join`; joined → `.play__top #player-greeting` (`Hi, NAME!`) persistent + `#play-body`: lobby `.waiting` (`Hi, NAME!` + waiting), open `.play-question__num/body` + `.play-options>form[data-option-form]>button.play-option(is-picked? + `Your answer` mark)`, closed `.play-question__num/body` + `.play-status(--right/--wrong/--neutral)` (`Correct!/Wrong!/No answer`), ended over. All labels exactly as spec.
