+## Prizes / scoring / winners (2026-10-08)
+- Quiz: added `winners_count` integer default 3, validates `>=1` (`Number of winners` via `human_attribute_name`). Form (`_form`, new+edit/Settings): `<label>Number of winners</label>` + `<input type=number min=1 required>`; `Quiz.new` defaults 3 via `after_initialize` + DB default. `QuizzesController` permits `:winners_count`. Export/import unchanged (title+questions only, winners not exported; import creates with default 3).
