+- Player controller: `show` for `ended+joined` sets `@result`; `answer` sets `elapsed_ms`; `player_state_json` for `ended+joined` adds `place,total_players,points,points_text,place_text,won`; otherwise no points/place/won (verified lobby/open/closed JSON has no points, open has no `correct`/feedback).
